Greetings, <%= @billable_entity %>

<% if @has_product_target %>
Your coupon for <%= @product_name %> has expired.
<% if @has_active_subscription %>
Your subscription will now be billed at the regular price of <%= @subscription_price %>/<%= @billing_cycle %>.
<% else %>
You don't currently have an active <%= @product_name %> subscription, so nothing will be charged.
<% end %>

You can manage your subscriptions from your billing page: <%= @licensing_url %>
<% else %>
We're sorry to say that your coupon for <%= branded_plan_name(@billable_entity.plan).titleize %> has expired.

If you'd like to continue with a paid plan, you can review your options and resubscribe: <%= @licensing_url %>
<% end %>
<% if @education_coupon %>

If you are still a student or teacher, you may apply for a new academic discount coupon at https://education.github.com.
<% end %>

If you feel there's been a mistake or have any questions, visit <%= contact_url %>

Thanks,
The GitHub Team
